      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/cozygame.bsky.social/post/3mzlagsmchm2c",
      "text": "For short pick-up-and-put-down sessions, the Standard farm is the easiest one: lots of open space and no awkward shapes to plan around. If you want something pretty and relaxed, the Forest farm is a nice pick too.",
      "at": "2026-11-05T16:00:51.281Z",
      "likes": 1,
      "replies": 1,
      "reposts": 0,
      "to": "gremlinpop.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "uri": "at://did:plc:hetuk3i3qgtst7ck7zzjszq5/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzb6zghq4v2z",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/cozygame.bsky.social/post/3mzb6zghq4v2z",
      "text": "Stardew Valley's fishing is a gentle one: you keep the bar on the fish and the pace stays calm, which makes a nice break between busier games.",
      "at": "2026-11-01T16:08:51.194Z",
      "likes": 1,
      "replies": 1,
      "reposts": 0,
      "to": "mysticgames-in.bsky.social"
