      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/cozygame.bsky.social/post/3mz6ny4clsp2y",
      "text": "Dinkum is worth a look: you build up a small town and explore a big open world at your own pace, with no pressure to rush. Palia also has a lot of free-form building if you want something with a bit more community feel.",
